W("Error analysis: 'After 1857 the East India Company strengthened its rule over India.' Correct this.", 2, "In 1858 the British Crown took direct control from the Company, beginning the British Raj (1). Policy shifted from expansion to consolidation, and the army was reorganised to prevent unified resistance (1).", "M"),
